milies, along with the training guide are printable progress charts made fun for toddlers and parents.","attributes":[{"name":"18 Pages ","value":"1.99"}],"description_html":"\u003cp\u003e🧻\u003cstrong\u003e Potty Time Made Simple: A Gentle Guide for Toddlers and Their Grown-Ups \u003c/strong\u003e🧸\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eThis potty training guide is a \u003cstrong\u003efun, stress-free resource\u003c/strong\u003e designed to help toddlers build independence and confidence as they learn to use the potty. Created with the needs of both children and caregivers in mind, it blends \u003cstrong\u003egentle routines\u003c/strong\u003e, \u003cstrong\u003eplayful encouragement\u003c/strong\u003e, and \u003cstrong\u003epractical tools\u003c/strong\u003e to support success at every step.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eInside, you’ll find:\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e• ✅ \u003cstrong\u003eStep-by-step guidance\u003c/strong\u003e for introducing the potty in a positive way\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e• 📅 \u003cstrong\u003ePrintable potty charts\u003c/strong\u003e with time-based reminders to build routine\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e• 🐻 \u003cstrong\u003eFriendly animal helpers\u003c/strong\u003e and colorful visuals to keep toddlers engaged\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e• 🎉 \u003cstrong\u003eReward ideas\u003c/strong\u003e to celebrate every small win\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e• 💡 \u003cstrong\u003eTips for setbacks\u003c/strong\u003e, nighttime training, and staying patient\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003ePerfect for children ages 18 months to 3 years, this guide makes potty learning a \u003cstrong\u003eteam effort\u003c/strong\u003e between toddlers and their grown-ups — with \u003cstrong\u003eno pressure\u003c/strong\u003e, just progress!\u003c/p\u003e","currency_code":"usd","price_cents":199,"buyer_currency_display":{"product_id":"IMr3dRUa8eG4tC6tcPe4wQ==","buyer_curren